//raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/23.png","artwork_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/23.png","species":{"habitat":"grassland","color":"purple","shape":"squiggle","generation":"generation-i","growth_rate":"medium","capture_rate":255,"base_happiness":70,"egg_groups":["ground","dragon"],"hatch_counter":20,"gender_rate":4,"is_legendary":false,"is_mythical":false},"flavor_texts":[{"game":"red","text":"Moves silently and stealthily. Eats the eggs of birds, such as PIDGEY and SPEAROW, whole."},{"game":"yellow","text":"The older it gets, the longer it grows. At night, it wraps its long body around tree branches to rest."},{"game":"gold","text":"It can freely de­ tach its jaw to swallow large prey whole. It can be­ come too heavy to move, however."},{"game":"silver","text":"It always hides in grass. When first born, it has no poison, so its bite is painful, but harmless."},{"game":"crystal","text":"It flutters the tip of its tongue to seek out the scent of prey, then swallows the prey whole."},{"game":"ruby","text":"EKANS curls itself up in a spiral while it rests. Assuming this position allows it to quickly respond to a threat from any direction with a glare from its upraised head."},{"game":"emerald","text":"An EKANS curls itself up in a spiral while it rests. This position allows it to quickly respond to an enemy from any direction with a threat from its upraised head."},{"game":"firered","text":"A very common sight in grassland, etc. It flicks its tongue in and out to sense danger in its surroundings."},{"game":"leafgreen","text":"Moving silently and stealthily, it eats the eggs of birds, such as PIDGEY and SPEAROW, whole."},{"game":"diamond","text":"It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind."},{"game":"heartgold","text":"It can freely detach its jaw to swallow large prey whole. It can become too heavy to move, however."},{"game":"y","text":"Moving silently and stealthily, it eats the eggs of birds, such as Pidgey and Spearow, whole."},{"game":"omega-ruby","text":"Ekans curls itself up in a spiral while it rests. Assuming this position allows it to quickly respond to a threat from any direction with a glare from its upraised head."},{"game":"ultra-sun","text":"By dislocating its jaw, it can swallow prey larger than itself. After a meal, it curls up and rests."},{"game":"ultra-moon","text":"The eggs of bird Pokémon are its favorite food. It swallows eggs whole, so sometimes an egg gets stuck, and Ekans faints."}],"evolution":{"chain":{"species":{"name":"ekans","url":"https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/pokemon-species/23/"},"evolves_to":[{"species":{"name":"arbok","url":"https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/pokemon-species/24/"},"evolution_details":[{"min_level":22,"trigger":{"name":"level-up"},"used_move":null}],"evolves_to":[]}]},"bulbapedia_condition":"= Ekans evolves into . (For specifics on this Pokémons Evolution in the games, refer to #Evolution data.) <div style=\"float:center; display:flex; flex-flow:row wrap;\"> </div>"},"locations":[{"game":"red","location":"Routes , , , , , and"},{"game":"gold","location":"Goldenrod Game Corner"},{"game":"silver","location":"Routes , , , and"},{"game":"crystal","location":"Routes , , , , and , Routes , , , , and , Azalea Town (Headbutt trees)"},{"game":"firered","location":"Routes , , , , , and"},{"game":"diamond","location":"Route 212 (Sinnoh) |Dual-slot mode|(FireRed)}}"},{"game":"pearl","location":"Route 212 (Sinnoh) |Dual-slot mode|(FireRed)}}"},{"game":"platinum","location":"Route 212 (Sinnoh) |Dual-slot mode|(FireRed)}}"},{"game":"heartgold","location":"Goldenrod Game Corner, Safari Zone (Johto) (tall grass in Marshland, default)"},{"game":"soulsilver","location":"Routes , , , and , Safari Zone (Johto) (tall grass in Marshland, default)"},{"game":"pal-park","location":"Forest"},{"game":"x","location":"Route 14 (Kalos) (Horde Encounter)"},{"game":"y","locati